+      "content": "You know the *ser* passive from B1 Unit 18: *La ley fue aprobada por el Parlamento*. It works because the thing that is affected becomes the subject, and the participle describes it, so the participle agrees with it like an adjective: *el puente fue construido*, *las casas fueron construidas*. What is new at B2 is the range. Only *ser* changes tense; the participle stays as it is. So you can use the passive for what happened (*fue publicada*), what has happened (*ha sido publicada*) and what will happen (*será publicada*)."
