+      "content": "A good test: if you can put *haber* before it, use the regular form (*han freído*); if it describes a noun or follows *estar*, use the short form (*frito*, *impreso*, *provisto*). *Electo* only describes someone elected who has not yet taken office; after *haber* the verb is always *elegido*."
