         ],
         [
-          "Esa obra novelística llegó a ser el clásico indiscutible del realismo social.",
-          "That novelistic work eventually became the unquestioned classic of social realism."
+          "La tienda llegó a ser una gran empresa.",
+          "The shop grew into a big company. (steps over time)"
         ],
         [
-          "El carbón de Lota llegó a ser el combustible fundamental de la armada nacional.",
-          "The coal of Lota eventually became the fundamental fuel of the national navy."
